# Z-UX versioning

Full policy: [VERSIONING.md](../../VERSIONING.md).

## Mode

- **Lockstep SemVer**: `@z-ux/tokens` and `@z-ux/ui` always share the **same** version (`@z-ux/charts` joins when published).
- Never bump only one publishable package.
- Apps (`docs`, `preview`) stay private; do not publish them.

## Bump choice

| Change | `0.x` | `1.0+` |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Bug fix, no API change | patch | patch |
| Additive feature / token | minor | minor |
| Breaking API or token contract | **minor** | **major** |

## Commits (drive CI)

Use conventional commits so auto-publish picks the right bump:

```text
fix(button): correct dark focus ring     → patch
feat(tokens): add elevation.ring         → minor
feat(button)!: rename ghost to subtle    → breaking (minor in 0.x)
```

## Do / don't

```text
✅ Keep both package.json versions equal
✅ Ask before a breaking token or prop rename
✅ Update docs when public contracts change
❌ Independent versions per package
❌ Hand-edit only one version
❌ Republish the same version
❌ Always default to patch when the change is a feature or break
```

## Tooling

- Bump: `node scripts/bump-publishable-versions.mjs --level=patch|minor|major`
- Publish path: `.github/workflows/publish.yml` on `main` when `packages/**` change
- Token source of truth remains `z-ui-token-sources` — never edit `dist/**` for a release
